WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.510
Cystic fibrosis is linked to
particular alleles of one gene.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.530
So is Huntington's disease.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.330
Its allele is dominant, but symptoms
usually start only in middle age.

4
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.470
The allele is there long
before the first symptom.

5
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.670
If a gene is faulty, can
we find it before birth,

6
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.340
or even fix it?

7
00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:23.960
In this mission, you'll weigh what each
option offers against what it costs.

8
00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.470
Then you'll test what you've
learned on a new case,

9
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.200
from a genetics clinic.

10
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.570
Your mission: find out whether a
faulty gene can be found before birth,

11
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:33.800
or even fixed.
